Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:18.38,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕挑戰數千回
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:21.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}哪怕失敗數萬次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:25.89,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}幾乎要放棄一切時
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.70,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}那無法言喻的心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.36,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}卻在吶喊「還能繼續努力」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:36.65,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\clip(320,1,320,460)\t(100,970,\clip(10,1,590,400))\fad(0,300)\blur1}於是再次堅定地許下心願
